OL,3,GNEWSANI pupils' scores in reading and
OL,4,Amaths fall over last decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FResults achieved by Northern Ireland's
OL,7,F15 year olds in international tests are
OL,8,Fa "wake-up call," according to the
OL,9,Feducation minister.
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland's scores were among
OL,12,Fthe best in the world in international
OL,13,Ftests in Science, but performance in
OL,14,FReading and Maths tests has fallen over
OL,15,Fthe past decade.
OL,17,FThat echoes a "huge" drop in reading
OL,18,Fskills for 15-year-olds globally.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
